   "road": "{\"name\":\"Cascade River Road\",\"status\":\"Paved for the first ~10 miles from SR 20 at Marblemount, then rough gravel; the final 3 miles to the trailhead are narrow with steep drop-offs.\",\"driveNote\":\"Same approach infrastructure as the Southwest Route; see that route for full access detail. Alternate southern access via Suiattle River Road (FR 26)/Downey Creek Trailhead is closed by a washout under a Forest Service order in effect April 2, 2026 through January 1, 2028.\",\"seasonalGate\":\"Gated in winter/early spring; typically opens to the Cascade Pass Trailhead parking area by late June.\"}",
